<p id="mwvg"><b id="mwvw">Notes</b></p>
<ul id="mwwA"><li id="mwwQ"><b id="mwwg">z</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwww"> </span>– Clinched home court advantage for the entire playoffs</li>
<li id="mwxA"><b id="mwxQ">c</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwxg"> </span>– Clinched home court advantage for the conference playoffs</li>
<li id="mwxw"><b id="mwyA">y</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwyQ"> </span>– Clinched division title</li>
<li id="mwyg"><b id="mwyw">x</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwzA"> </span>– Clinched playoff spot</li>
<li id="mwzQ"><b id="mwzg">pi</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwzw"> </span>– Clinched play-in tournament spot</li>
<li id="mw0A"><b id="mw0Q">*</b><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mw0g"> </span>– Division leader</li></ul>

