</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwATw" aria-labelledby="Game_summaries"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Game_summaries">Game summaries</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2022_NBA_Finals&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Game summaries"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<dl id="mwAT0"><dd id="mwAT4"><i id="mwAT8">Note: Times are <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastern_Time_Zone" title="Eastern Time Zone" id="mwAUA">EDT</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTC−04:00" title="UTC−04:00" id="mwAUE">UTC−4</a>) as listed by the NBA. For games in San Francisco, the local time is also given (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_Time_Zone" title="Pacific Time Zone" id="mwAUI">PDT</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTC−07:00" title="UTC−07:00" id="mwAUM">UTC−7</a>).</i></dd></dl>

