<table style="background-color:#eee; color:#202122; float:right; width:24%; table-layout:fixed">
<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chase_Center" title="Chase Center">Chase Center</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Francisco" title="San Francisco">San Francisco, California</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 18,064<br/><b>Referees:</b> 
