<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt149" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAck" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"multiple image\n ","href":"./Template:Multiple_image"},"params":{"align":{"wt":"left"},"total_width":{"wt":"320"},"image1":{"wt":"Jaylen Brown 2017.jpg"},"image2":{"wt":"Jayson Tatum (cropped).jpg"},"footer":{"wt":"[[Jaylen Brown]] (left) and [[Jayson Tatum]] (right) combined for 53 points, with Tatum scoring 15 of his 26 in the second half.&lt;ref>{{cite news|title=How the Celtics defeated the Warriors in Game 3 of the NBA Finals|date=June 14, 2022|work=The Athletic|url=https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/live-blogs/warriors-celtics-nba-finals-game-3/F8V6ubXlZ6vD/|access-date=June 16, 2022}}&lt;/ref>"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1349637415/mw-parser-output/.tmulti" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt150" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Multiple image/styles.css","wrapper":".tmulti"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow{display:flex;flex-direction:row;clear:left;flex-wrap:wrap;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle{margin:1px;float:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .theader{clear:both;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;align-self:center;background-color:transparent;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .thumbcaption{background-color:transparent}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-left{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-right{text-align:right}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .text-align-center{text-align:center}@media all and (max-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .tmulti .thumbinner{width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:none!important;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow{justify-content:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle{float:none!important;max-width:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .tsingle .thumbcaption{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .tmulti .trow>.thumbcaption{text-align:center}}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage{background-color:inherit}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.skin-invert-image):not(.skin-invert):not(.bg-transparent) img,html.skin-theme-clientpref-day .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.bg-transparent) img{background-color:white}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .tmulti .multiimageinner .thumbimage:not([style*="background-color"]) span:not(.skin-invert-image):not(.skin-invert):not(.bg-transparent) img{background-color:white}}</style></span><div class="thumb tmulti floatleft" about="#mwt149"><div class="thumbinner multiimageinner" style="width:312px;max-width:312px"><div class="trow"><div class="tsingle" style="width:128px;max-width:128px"><div class="thumbimage" style="height:205px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg/250px-Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg/330px-Jaylen_Brown_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1375" data-file-height="2237" data-file-type="bitmap" height="205" width="126" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div></div><div class="tsingle" style="width:180px;max-width:180px"><div class="thumbimage" style="height:205px;overflow:hidden"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jayson_Tatum_(cropped).jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jayson_Tatum_(cropped).jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Jayson_Tatum_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Jayson_Tatum_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Jayson_Tatum_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Jayson_Tatum_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="3413" data-file-height="3935" data-file-type="bitmap" height="205" width="178" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div></div></div><div class="trow" style="display:flex"><div class="thumbcaption"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaylen_Brown" title="Jaylen Brown">Jaylen Brown</a> (left) and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jayson_Tatum" title="Jayson Tatum">Jayson Tatum</a> (right) combined for 53 points, with Tatum scoring 15 of his 26 in the second half.<sup about="#mwt153" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-40" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-40"}}'><a href="#cite_note-40" id="mwAco"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAcs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAcw">[</span>40<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAc0">]</span></span></a></sup></div></div></div></div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt149"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_multiple_image_with_auto_scaled_images"/></span>

<p id="mwAc4">Brown scored 27 points and Tatum had 26 in a 116–100 Boston win for a 2–1 series lead. The Celtics led by as many as 18 points in the first half, but Golden State again surged in the third quarter, outscoring Boston 33–25 behind 15 points from Curry. The Warriors briefly took the lead at 83–82, but the Celtics were back up at 93–89 at the end of the period. Boston outscored Golden State 23–11 in the fourth quarter.<sup about="#mwt158" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_06082022_41-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_06082022"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ap_06082022-41"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_06082022-41" id="mwAc8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdE">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdI">]</span></span></a></sup> The Celtics were the more physical team,<sup about="#mwt161" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ganguli_06092022_42-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ganguli_06092022"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ganguli_06092022-42"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ganguli_06092022-42" id="mwAdM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdU">[</span>42<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdY">]</span></span></a></sup> outscoring the Warriors 52–26 in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paint_(basketball)" title="Paint (basketball)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAdc">paint</a> and outrebounding them 47–31.<sup about="#mwt162" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_06082022_41-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_06082022"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_06082022-41" id="mwAdg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdo">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAds">]</span></span></a></sup> Boston's <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Williams_III" title="Robert Williams III" id="mwAdw">Robert Williams III</a> had 10 rebounds and four of the team's seven <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Block_(basketball)" title="Block (basketball)" id="mwAd0">blocks</a>.<sup about="#mwt163" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ganguli_06092022_42-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ganguli_06092022"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ganguli_06092022-42" id="mwAd4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAd8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeA">[</span>42<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAeI">Curry finished with 31 points and six 3-pointers, and Thompson added 25 points and five 3s.<sup about="#mwt164" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_06082022_41-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_06082022"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_06082022-41" id="mwAeM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAeQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeU">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeY">]</span></span></a></sup> Green was held to two points, four rebounds, and three assists before fouling out for the second time in the series.<sup about="#mwt167" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-43" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-43"}}'><a href="#cite_note-43" id="mwAec"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAeg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAek">[</span>43<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeo">]</span></span></a></sup> He became the first player in Finals history to foul out after playing at least 34 minutes with less than five points, five rebounds and five assists.<sup about="#mwt170" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-44" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-44"}}'><a href="#cite_note-44" id="mwAes"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAew"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAe0">[</span>44<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAe4">]</span></span></a></sup> Curry was injured late in the fourth when Horford fell on his leg while chasing a loose ball.<sup about="#mwt171" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_06082022_41-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_06082022"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_06082022-41" id="mwAe8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfE">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfI">]</span></span></a></sup> Green received his sixth foul, which ejected him from the game when he pushed a Celtic from the pile; Green said Curry was howling in pain at the bottom of the pileup. The following day, Curry was confident that he would play in Game 4, saying it was "just a pain tolerance thing that you've got to deal with". He said it was not as bad as the injury that kept him out for the final 12 games of the regular season when Boston's Smart rolled over his foot when they went for a loose ball.<sup about="#mwt174" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-45" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-45"}}'><a href="#cite_note-45" id="mwAfM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfU">[</span>45<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt175" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"clear","href":"./Template:Clear"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'></div>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="12" id="mwAfg" aria-labelledby="Game_4"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Game_4">Game 4</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2022_NBA_Finals&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12" title="Edit section: Game 4"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt176" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Basketballbox","href":"./Template:Basketballbox"},"params":{"bg":{"wt":"#eee"},"date":{"wt":"June 10"},"time":{"wt":"9:00 pm"},"place":{"wt":"[[TD Garden]], [[Boston|Boston, Massachusetts]]"},"TV":{"wt":"[[NBA on ABC|ABC]]"},"team1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;[[Golden State Warriors]]&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"score1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;107&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"team2":{"wt":"[[Boston Celtics]]"},"score2":{"wt":"97"},"report":{"wt":"[https://www.nba.com/game/gsw-vs-bos-0042100404 Recap]"},"Q1":{"wt":"27–&apos;&apos;&apos;28&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q2":{"wt":"22–&apos;&apos;&apos;26&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;30&apos;&apos;&apos;–24"},"Q4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;28&apos;&apos;&apos;–19"},"points1":{"wt":"[[Stephen Curry]] 43"},"points2":{"wt":"[[Jayson Tatum]] 23"},"rebounds1":{"wt":"[[Andrew Wiggins]] 16"},"rebounds2":{"wt":"[[Robert Williams III]] 12"},"assist1":{"wt":"[[Draymond Green]] 8"},"assist2":{"wt":"Jayson Tatum 6"},"attendance":{"wt":"19,156"},"referee":{"wt":"*No. 19 James Capers\n*No. 5 Kane Fitzgerald\n*No. 42 Eric Lewis"},"series":{"wt":"Series tied 2–2"}},"i":0}}]}'></div><div style="width: 100%; background-color:#eee; color:#202122;" about="#mwt176" id="mwAfo">
